# Epipolar air fog
screen.AIR_FOG_DENSITY = Air Density
screen.AIR_FOG_DENSITY.comment = Density by height, time of day and rain.
screen.AIR_FOG_LIGHTING = Air Lighting
screen.AIR_FOG_LIGHTING.comment = Air scattering and shadow controls.
screen.EPIPOLAR = Epipolar Sampling
screen.EPIPOLAR.comment = Air shadow marching and reconstruction quality.
option.AIR_FOG = Air Fog
option.AIR_FOG.comment = Height-based air fog with optional shadow-map light shafts.
option.AIR_FOG_INTENSITY = Scattering Strength
option.AIR_FOG_INTENSITY.comment = Brightness of the scattered light; fog density is unchanged.
option.AIR_FOG_DENSITY_DAY = Day Density
option.AIR_FOG_DENSITY_DAY.comment = Clear-weather density at the reference height during daytime.
option.AIR_FOG_DENSITY_DUSK = Twilight Density
option.AIR_FOG_DENSITY_DUSK.comment = Clear-weather density around sunrise and sunset.
option.AIR_FOG_DENSITY_NIGHT = Night Density
option.AIR_FOG_DENSITY_NIGHT.comment = Clear-weather density when the sun is below the horizon.
option.AIR_FOG_DENSITY_RAIN = Rain Density Gain
option.AIR_FOG_DENSITY_RAIN.comment = Extra neutral haze while it rains, scaled by rainfall; the clear-sky air color is unchanged.
option.AIR_FOG_REFERENCE_HEIGHT_M = Reference Height
option.AIR_FOG_REFERENCE_HEIGHT_M.comment = World height where the clear-weather density equals the selected day/twilight/night value.
option.AIR_FOG_SCALE_HEIGHT_M = Density Scale Height
option.AIR_FOG_SCALE_HEIGHT_M.comment = How fast air thins with altitude: every scale height up, density drops to about 37%.
option.AIR_FOG_SKY_STRENGTH = Sky Scattering Strength
option.AIR_FOG_SKY_STRENGTH.comment = Brightness of the ambient sky scattering in the air.
option.AIR_FOG_SHADOWS = Fog Shadows
screen.PLANTS = Plants
screen.PLANTS.comment = Wind response of plants and leaf blocks.
option.PLANT_WIND = Plant Wind
option.PLANT_WIND.comment = Wind sways plants and their shadows move to match. Cane, bamboo, attached and aquatic plants stay still.
option.PLANT_WIND_STRENGTH = Wind Strength
option.PLANT_WIND_STRENGTH.comment = Overall wind force; rain strengthens it automatically. 0 stops all plant motion.
option.PLANT_WIND_GRASS = Grass and Flower Sway
option.PLANT_WIND_GRASS.comment = Flexibility of grass, flowers, crops and saplings; tall plants bend along their whole stem.
option.PLANT_WIND_LEAVES = Leaf Sway
option.PLANT_WIND_LEAVES.comment = Flexibility of leaf blocks; shared corners move together so canopies stay seamless.
option.AIR_FOG_SHADOWS.comment = Objects cast shadows into the air itself, so haze darkens behind obstacles. Requires Epipolar Sampling.
option.EPIPOLAR_VOLUMETRICS = Epipolar Air Light
option.EPIPOLAR_VOLUMETRICS.comment = Depth-aware reconstruction of the air shadows; applies to air only.
option.EPIPOLAR_SLICES = Epipolar Slices
option.EPIPOLAR_SLICES.comment = Number of screen-space slice lines.
option.EPIPOLAR_SAMPLES = Samples per Slice
option.EPIPOLAR_SAMPLES.comment = Depth-keyed air columns stored per slice.
option.AIR_EPIPOLAR_SHADOW_STEPS = Uniform Shadow Steps
option.AIR_EPIPOLAR_SHADOW_STEPS.comment = Shadow march steps per air column.
option.EPIPOLAR_DEPTH_TOLERANCE = Depth Match Tolerance
option.EPIPOLAR_DEPTH_TOLERANCE.comment = Allowed depth mismatch when reconstructing air columns.
option.EPIPOLAR_EDGE_EXTEND = Edge Search Samples
option.EPIPOLAR_EDGE_EXTEND.comment = How far the search for matching air columns extends near silhouettes.
